  <item>
    <title>53.不会休息的人：为什么一闲下来，我反而更焦虑？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a93c302f03e74ee6b01fd88</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a93c302f03e74ee6b01fd88</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 05:48:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我邀请 Toby 和小白一起聊了聊我们三个人完全不同的生活方式：有人习惯通过计划获得掌控感，有人更相信“把人生拉远一点看”，有人则天然更相信自己的身体和欲望。</span></p><p><span>聊着聊着，我们从“怎么放松”，一路聊到了计划性焦虑、AI心理对话、短视频成瘾、兴趣与恐惧驱动、竞争与羞耻，以及一个越来越难回答的问题：</span></p><p><strong><span>如果我不再用焦虑逼着自己前进，我还知道自己真正想要什么吗？</span></strong></p><p></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;五一假期：我们真的会休息吗？</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="425">07:05</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;为什么一闲下来，我就忍不住做计划？</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="922">15:22</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;计划为什么会变成我的安全感？</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1613">26:53</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;身体不会欺骗你：三个人如何面对焦虑</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;「安排放松」还算真正的放松吗？</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2415">40:15</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;不做计划以后，我刷了一整天短视频</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2577">42:57</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;问题真的是“成瘾”吗？</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3416">56:56</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;兴趣驱动，还是恐惧驱动？</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4530">1:15:30</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;从身体出发：允许自己试错</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4792">1:19:52</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;我真正想要的，到底是什么？</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4872">1:21:12</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;不知道自己想要什么，也可以吗？</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5008">1:23:28</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;我们各自真正的“天赋”是什么？</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5608">1:33:28</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;我想赢，还是我只是害怕失败？</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5717">1:35:17</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;童年、考试与害怕被否定</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6181">1:43:01</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;探索自己，是一个长久的课题</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/635e029cb1665c4cb08bc8d6/lkNFFJopxp1X2SBqVREBOj9rsoy-.m4a" length="100586502" type="audio/mp4"/>
