  <item>
    <title>47.手机大脑|刷手机不是你的错，是祖先在报警：1小时速通&lt;手机大脑&gt;</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6880f841a9dec92500d35640</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6880f841a9dec92500d35640</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 01 Aug 2025 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本用1小时把《手机大脑》嚼成一碗鸡汤：现代人所有焦虑、刷机、拖延、emo，都是原始大脑在2025年的“水土不服”；学会识别信号、拆分目标、动一动身体，就能重启系统。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开场：为什么短视频一滑就2小时？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">03:10</a> 进化速度 vs 科技爆炸：A4纸1万点图秒懂错配</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a> 情绪=大脑遥控器，负面才带流量</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a> 房贷=狮子？长期压力如何拖垮身体</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a> 杏仁核过度安检：桌面越乱，注意力越碎</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1695">28:15</a> 焦虑：人类专属“未来预测”外挂</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2090">34:50</a> 抑郁：大脑的强制关机，也是免疫系统的替身</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2465">41:05</a> 多巴胺不制造快乐，只负责“勾魂”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2910">48:30</a> 注意力残留实验：手机静音也降智商</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> 对抗成瘾的万能钥匙：运动=模拟捕猎</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3680">61:20</a> 3个自救锦囊：识别长期压力、拆分目标、每天动一动</span><br><span></span></p>]]></description>
